@ref Form 23 heading (src:18452)
GIVETH A LIST OF `Provision of the Code`
`form 23 the sections that prescribe it` MEANS
    LIST `forms 1 to 23 the provision` 83.3 ""
    , `forms 1 to 23 the provision` 810 ""
    , `forms 1 to 23 the provision` 810.01 ""
    , `forms 1 to 23 the provision` 810.011 ""
    , `forms 1 to 23 the provision` 810.03 ""
    , `forms 1 to 23 the provision` 810.1 ""
    , `forms 1 to 23 the provision` 810.2 ""

-- The thin lookup over the per-Form constants above. A repealed Form has no sections to name: the empty list.
GIVEN f IS A `forms 1 to 23 which Form`
GIVETH A LIST OF `Provision of the Code`
`forms 1 to 23 the sections that prescribe the form` MEANS
    CONSIDER f
    WHEN `form 1` THEN `form 1 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 2` THEN `form 2 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 3` THEN EMPTY   -- the Form is shown repealed
    WHEN `form 4` THEN `form 4 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5` THEN `form 5 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.001` THEN `form 5.001 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.002` THEN `form 5.002 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.003` THEN `form 5.003 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.0031` THEN `form 5.0031 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.0032` THEN `form 5.0032 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.004` THEN `form 5.004 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.005` THEN `form 5.005 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.0051` THEN `form 5.0051 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.006` THEN `form 5.006 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.007` THEN `form 5.007 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.008` THEN `form 5.008 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.0081` THEN `form 5.0081 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.009` THEN `form 5.009 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.0091` THEN `form 5.0091 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.01` THEN `form 5.01 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.02` THEN `form 5.02 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.03` THEN `form 5.03 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.04` THEN `form 5.04 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.041` THEN `form 5.041 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.05` THEN `form 5.05 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.06` THEN `form 5.06 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.061` THEN `form 5.061 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.062` THEN `form 5.062 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.07` THEN `form 5.07 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.08` THEN `form 5.08 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.09` THEN `form 5.09 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.1` THEN `form 5.1 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.2` THEN `form 5.2 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 5.3` THEN `form 5.3 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 6` THEN `form 6 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 6.1` THEN `form 6.1 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 6.2` THEN `form 6.2 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 6.3` THEN `form 6.3 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 6.4` THEN `form 6.4 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 7` THEN `form 7 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 7.1` THEN `form 7.1 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 8` THEN `form 8 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 9` THEN `form 9 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 10` THEN `form 10 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 10.1` THEN `form 10.1 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 11` THEN `form 11 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 11.1` THEN `form 11.1 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 12` THEN `form 12 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 13` THEN EMPTY   -- the Form is shown repealed
    WHEN `form 14` THEN EMPTY   -- the Form is shown repealed
    WHEN `form 15` THEN `form 15 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 16` THEN `form 16 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 16.1` THEN `form 16.1 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 17` THEN `form 17 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 18` THEN `form 18 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 19` THEN `form 19 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 20` THEN `form 20 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 21` THEN `form 21 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 22` THEN `form 22 the sections that prescribe it`
    WHEN `form 23` THEN `form 23 the sections that prescribe it`

-- The process document a Form prescribes, by the Form's own title; NOTHING where the core has no member for it.
-- (Forms 5.061, 6.2, 6.3 and 10.1 are titled Summons or Undertaking but are not the Form 6 summons or the Form 10 undertaking that
-- section 2 defines: see the fork register in NOTES.md; this table answers what the TITLE calls the document.)
GIVEN f IS A `forms 1 to 23 which Form`
GIVETH A MAYBE `Process document`
`forms 1 to 23 the process document the form prescribes` MEANS
    CONSIDER f
    WHEN `form 1` THEN JUST `an information`
    WHEN `form 2` THEN JUST `an information`
    WHEN `form 3` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Form's title is not the name of any process document the core lists
    WHEN `form 4` THEN JUST `an indictment`
    WHEN `form 5` THEN JUST `a search warrant`
    WHEN `form 5.001` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Form's title is not the name of any process document the core lists
    WHEN `form 5.002` THEN JUST `an information`
    WHEN `form 5.003` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Form's title is not the name of any process document the core lists
    WHEN `form 5.0031` THEN JUST `an information`
    WHEN `form 5.0032` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Form's title is not the name of any process document the core lists
    WHEN `form 5.004` THEN JUST `an information`
    WHEN `form 5.005` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Form's title is not the name of any process document the core lists
    WHEN `form 5.0051` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Form's title is not the name of any process document the core lists
    WHEN `form 5.006` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Form's title is not the name of any process document the core lists
    WHEN `form 5.007` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Form's title is not the name of any process document the core lists
    WHEN `form 5.008` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Form's title is not the name of any process document the core lists
    WHEN `form 5.0081` THEN JUST `an information`
    WHEN `form 5.009` THEN JUST `an information`
    WHEN `form 5.0091` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Form's title is not the name of any process document the core lists
    WHEN `form 5.01` THEN JUST `an information`
    WHEN `form 5.02` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Form's title is not the name of any process document the core lists
    WHEN `form 5.03` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Form's title is not the name of any process document the core lists
    WHEN `form 5.04` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Form's title is not the name of any process document the core lists
    WHEN `form 5.041` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Form's title is not the name of any process document the core lists
    WHEN `form 5.05` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Form's title is not the name of any process document the core lists
    WHEN `form 5.06` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Form's title is not the name of any process document the core lists
    WHEN `form 5.061` THEN JUST `a summons`
    WHEN `form 5.062` THEN JUST `a warrant for arrest`
    WHEN `form 5.07` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Form's title is not the name of any process document the core lists
    WHEN `form 5.08` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Form's title is not the name of any process document the core lists
    WHEN `form 5.09` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Form's title is not the name of any process document the core lists
    WHEN `form 5.1` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Form's title is not the name of any process document the core lists
    WHEN `form 5.2` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Form's title is not the name of any process document the core lists
    WHEN `form 5.3` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Form's title is not the name of any process document the core lists
    WHEN `form 6` THEN JUST `a summons`
    WHEN `form 6.1` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Form's title is not the name of any process document the core lists
    WHEN `form 6.2` THEN JUST `a summons`
    WHEN `form 6.3` THEN JUST `a summons`
    WHEN `form 6.4` THEN JUST `a warrant for arrest`
    WHEN `form 7` THEN JUST `a warrant for arrest`
    WHEN `form 7.1` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Form's title is not the name of any process document the core lists
